            "notes": "This is what I start with every stadium match. It has additional 7 HPS and a little bit of survivability. \n\n*** [Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb):***\nIn my opinion, if you don\u2019t start with Threads of Fate, you start off wrong. This power is the best one hands down. You are immediately 50% more effective with both damage boost and healing for the first two rounds and that is more than ANY other power or item can give you.\n\n(yes, it's worth it after the nerf!)\n\n*** [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0):***\n5% Weapon Power, this is the best 1k item you can get.\n\n*** [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf):***\n5% Attack Speed, this is the second best 1k item you can get.\n\n*** [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da):***\n25 Shields + 33% time reduction on your self healing. This gives you an extra 25 regenerating shield and faster recovery for your support passive  when you cannot heal with Sympathetic Recovery.",
